  "bodyHash": "b53338438bafd751",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">載具升級</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 為遊戲中所有的坐騎和載具帶來極致強化，為每次出行增添了大量提升生活質量的改進。佩戴鞍座的坐騎不再會四處遊蕩，船隻在陸地上的操控性更好，並且你可以在騎乘時打開玩家物品欄。一些細小而強大的改進，例如向下看時坐騎變為半透明，以及修復了防止你卡在方塊中的乘客碰撞檢測，讓旅途和工作與載具的配合變得更加流暢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓坐騎在水中游泳，穿過樹葉，並在騎乘時保持完整的挖掘速度。該模組帶來了精緻的優化、靈活性以及大量的樂趣，使每次旅程都更平滑、更快速。當然，所有功能均可完全配置以適應你的遊戲風格。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">坐騎游泳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 穿越水域時保持騎乘狀態。即使完全淹沒在水中，你也可以控制何時下馬。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌿 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿過樹葉：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 坐騎可以穿過樹葉而不會卡住。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚖️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">防止遊蕩：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 佩戴鞍座的坐騎會停留在你離開它們的地方，不會四處遊蕩。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪞 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">半透明視角：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 向下看時，你的坐騎會變淡，以便你能看到下方的情況。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">物品欄切換：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 騎乘時可以通過按鍵、雙擊或屏幕按鈕打開載具或玩家物品欄。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⛏️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完整挖掘速度：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 騎乘時不再減慢你的方塊破壞速度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">騎乘時衝刺：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在坐騎上衝刺以獲得快速的速度加成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更聰明的馬匹：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 馬匹可以跨越稍高一點的障礙，高度從 1.0 增加到 1.1 個方塊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">划船時手持物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 劃船時顯示地圖等手持物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">船隻跨步高度：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 船隻可以滑上低矮的方塊，以跨越地毯或小路等短障礙物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">縮小大型乘客：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 高大的騎乘者會自動縮小，以便更好地適應船隻。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">修正載具碰撞：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 乘客在與方塊碰撞時不再被忽略。再也不用擔心卡在天花板裡窒息了！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">互動範圍加成：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 騎乘時可以從坐騎上觸及更遠的目標。非常適合戰鬥和建造。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⛳ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">下馬控制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 蹲下並用空手右鍵點擊，可以將乘客從載具上移除。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完全可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 每個功能都有簡單的設置，讓你根據喜好調整體驗。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端必須安裝 &amp; 服務端必需</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （適用於 Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支持，可以直接使用模組菜單（Fabric 版需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）在遊戲內進行配置。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 也是必需的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">對於使用外部文本編輯器進行手動配置，所有文件都位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目錄中，名稱分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具體取決於配置文件的類型。並非所有模組都存在所有類型的配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lobsterjonn\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">LobsterJonn</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jumpy-boats\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Jumpy Boats</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，它啟發了本模組中有趣的船隻跳躍機制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cammie\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Cammie</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vehiclefix\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">VehicleFix</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，它是正確實現載具乘客碰撞機制的靈感來源。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">向 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/legosteenjaap\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">legosteenjaap</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 致敬，他的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseinboat\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">HorseInBoat</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 最終給了我們讓馬匹乘坐船隻的想法。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/teaj4y\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">TeaJ4y</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horsestatsvanilla\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Horse Stats Vanilla</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，啟發了在物品欄中可選地顯示坐騎屬性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/CassieNya\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CassieNya</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/horsebuff\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Horse Buff</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，它啟發了如坐騎半透明等創意功能。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dyed-flames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/dyedflames/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/all-the-heads\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-tridents\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
